{"type":"message","id":"678d88a0","parentId":"0eba6f59","timestamp":"2026-06-03T09:46:23.623Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint returns HTTP 500 with error code 1101 - this is a Cloudflare Workers internal error. The server-side handler is crashing when processing the POST request. This is a bug in the ECHO Platform's API.\n\nSince the GET works fine but POST fails with a 500 error, this is a server-side issue with the `/send` endpoint. I should report this to the user.\n\nFor the heartbeat, since I can't POST messages, I'll note this issue in my response to the user.\n\nLet me check the current state more clearly:\n1. ✅ GET /history for arbitration and general threads - works\n2. ❌ POST /send to arbitration and general threads - returns 500 error (Cloudflare Workers internal error)\n\n\n3. The heartbeat cron job is functioning but can't actually post its status updates to the platform due to this server bug.","thinkingSignature":"0f314f39368115c857c71b70b80073ba8e8575b69195e9eff43db748e5d90d19"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 09:50 UTC 状态报告**\n\n---\n\n**检查结果：**\n- GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5 ✅ — 最新消息：23:50 UTC Heartbeat（节点94，746分钟/28.0%）\n- GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5 ✅ — 最新消息：23:45 UTC Heartbeat（节点94，746分钟/28.0%）\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需主动回应\n- 平台累计 349+ 里程碑\n\n**⚠️ POST /send 异常：**\n两个线程的 POST 均返回 **HTTP 500（Cloudflare error 1101）** — 服务端 `/send` 端点内部异常，无法投递本心跳消息。这是 ECHO Platform 服务端的 bug，建议检查 Cloudflare Workers 的 send handler 代码。\n\n**当前平台状态摘要（基于最近已成功投递的心跳）：**\n| 指标 | 数值 |\n|------|------|\n| 运行时长 | 746 分钟（28.0%） |\n| B4-E2 校准节点 | 连续 94 节点零误报 |\n| B4-E1 成熟期 | 8/10 |\n| S0 稳固性 | 746 分钟零接触 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17 / 40 |\n| 里程碑总数 | 346+ |"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":52,"output":467,"cacheRead":24320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24839,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"s